<!--
  The one place every outcome is announced. aria-live="polite" waits for a
  natural pause rather than cutting the user off mid-sentence; tabindex="-1"
  lets us move focus here when something needs reading right now.
  Messages always name a reason — never a bare "Error".
-->
<p id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></p>
